{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791862500, "covers_from": "2026-10-13T03:35:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-13T03:36:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791862560, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-13T03:35:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "queue_number": 62966, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "越來越多機車騎上人行道，汽車也有！違規停車也變多，無法檢舉警察也沒有主動取締", "display_name": "士林代表 melanie", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T03:35:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8269, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "觀光", "content": "很多觀光客必吃的餐廳都很髒，是否可以請他們花點錢整理一下環境，或好好洗碗（劉山東、兩喜號、巧之味後場", "display_name": "中正代表 No.8,269", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T03:35:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 7389, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "把樹種回來！越多越好，台北市的市容已經很醜了，不能再沒有樹了", "display_name": "中正代表 No.7,389", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T03:35:36+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11484, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我住新竹、高雄是台北房東。希望台北能當一個推動動物福利的領頭羊，用更高規格善待所有帶給人們幸福的動物", "display_name": "大安代表 Jeannette", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T03:35:51+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11759, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "觀光", "content": "我是旅客，很喜歡台北，年年來，但台北越來越無聊，都沒新意", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.11,759", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 8269, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.8,269", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 7389, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.7,389", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay"